edits_description = "Clouds were edited to make it look more like a floating shard. More shards were added to the horizon."
final_image_tex = SubResource("Resource_e8tul")
province = 66
blurb = "A fantastic view of a wooden bridge on Mount Gyōdō, popular with mountaineering ascetics, located north of Ashikaga.

The ascetics' training halls, built on a high rock formation, are connected to a small shrine perched on an isolated crag near a bridge crossing over the gorge, which is enveloped in thick clouds.

This is likely reimagined from historical records, as the bridge did not exist during Hokusai's time."
